@page "/signed-out"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]
@layout MainLayout

@* Where the provider sends an operator who has signed out, and the one page an anonymous caller
   may read: whoever lands here has just stopped being anybody, and a page that asked them to sign
   in before it could say they had signed out would be a page nobody ever saw. The way back is the
   home page, which asks them to sign in the moment they follow it. *@

<PageTitle>Signed out</PageTitle>

<h1>Signed out</h1>

<p>Your session here has ended. <a href="">Sign in again</a> to come back.</p>
